      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-12T02:50:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There are people who can command birds and then there are people who can turn into birds. The Matriarch is one of those two types.</p>\n<p>I half expect a vampire type villain at some point in SotM to have a ongoing called “colony of bats” that reduces/ignores the first damage inflicted every turn.</p>",
