      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-12T11:37:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nice… that is one of those movies that simultaneously looks gorgeous (I like the photography) and inane. Still throw in crows and such and I’m a sucker for that sort of visual imagery.</p>\n<p>With fables being as huge as it is, I think in the “late” years of expansion <span class=\"hashtag\">#26</span> or whatnot there should be a straight up fable based villain with dark(er) versions of the huntsman, rumplestilskin, the wicked witch, big bad wolf and so on as minions. And of course the storytale enviroment. “Flip, Poison Apple: any player may destroy this card to regain 5 hp but skip his turn”. “Flip… an angry Jabberwocky!”</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
